{
  "slug": "pulser",
  "name": "Pulser",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Lint and diagnose Claude Code SKILL.md files against Anthropic's 8 best-practice rules. Scans frontmatter, description quality, file size, gotchas, allowed-tools, structure, conflicts, and usage hooks. Auto-classifies skill types and generates fix prescriptions. Installs as a skill — say \"check my skills\" or /pulser to run",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `skill` (Diagnose and test Claude Code skills against Anthropic's 7 principles).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pulser@claude-community` from `TheStack-ai/pulser`.\n\n\"Check my skills.\" Diagnose, classify, prescribe, and fix — without leaving the conversation.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
